   431	while still holding the home lock. GC failure is reported as a maintenance
   432	warning and does not roll back the successful installation. The manager
   433	releases the manager-home lock before releasing project locks.
   434	
   435	Lock ordering is fixed: project operation locks in canonical order, then at
   436	most one optional cache-build lock, which is released, then the manager-home
