   465	An upgrade resolves and fetches only the selected scope's direct declarations
   466	and their transitive dependency closure. An operation over several projects
   467	MUST deduplicate fetches of the same checkout. A global-scope upgrade fetches
   468	only the global dependency closure. A separate update operation MAY fetch all
   469	managed source repositories.
