The focused suite is independently green: 61 passed. The audit has nevertheless reproduced a fail-safe violation outside that suite: after a prepared journal’s only marker-bearing generation disappears, GC reports no uncertainty and deletes the old referenced build. I also reproduced an entry-swap window where a young replacement is removed after only the old entry was verified. I’m validating the remaining static gates and sizing the rework precisely.
